---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — From the Cabinet"
  description="About From the Cabinet and its author, Jakub Pacocha."
>
  <div class="wrap about-page">
    <div class="col-wide">
      <header class="about-head">
        <span class="kicker enter" style="--d: 0"></span>
        <h1 class="about-head__title enter" style="--d: 1">
          On slow writing.
        </h1>
        <p class="about-meta kicker enter" style="--d: 2">
          <span>Jakub Pacocha</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="mailto:pacochp@gmail.com">pacochp@gmail.com</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose enter" style="--d: 3">
        <p>
          I write essays and treatises to map the edges of attention, technology, and
          personal ethics. The goal is not to achieve maximum clarity, but rather to snapshot a
          thought; the slow construction of arguments that can be revisited over the years.
        </p>
        <p>
          Although I think of myself as a true agnostic, you can and will find some takes on theology as well.
        </p>

        <h2>Writing practice</h2>
        <p>
          My drafts begin as brief notes. I collect observations, then compress them into
          essays once the theme reveals itself. Every piece here is a finished draft, but
          not a final work.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each text stands alone with its references and a stable URL, so the archive can
          live on the web without losing its shape.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact &amp; Elsewhere</h2>
        <p>
          If you want to share a response, recommendation, or critique, send a note to{' '}
          <a href="mailto:pacochp@gmail.com">pacochp@gmail.com</a>. Elsewhere on the web:{' '}
          <a href="https://www.jakubpacocha.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website</a>,{' '}
          <a href="https://jakubpacocha.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Substack</a>,{' '}
          <a href="https://x.com/JakubPacocha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>,{' '}
          <a href="https://mastodon.social/@JakubPacocha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mastodon</a>,{' '}
          and{' '}
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jakubpacocha/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vh, 4.75rem);
  }

  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--s-5);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-head__title {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-meta a {
    transition: color var(--dur-1) ease;
  }

  .about-meta a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
